  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Climate Resilience and Food Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Enhancing Climate Resilience and Food Security Project will support Maldives&amp;apos; efforts to build climate resilience focusing on the interlinkages between human settlement and agri-food systems. It will enhance the country&amp;apos;s adaptation capacity in line with Maldives Climate Change Policy Framework (MCCPF) and Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC).</narrative>
  </description>
